## English common-word list

`engine/research/data/en_common_words.txt` is derived from the English
frequency data in wordfreq 3.1.1, the "best" list, by Robyn Speer
(<https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq>). It keeps every alphabetic word whose
Zipf frequency on that list is at least 4.5. The Zipf scale was proposed by
Marc Brysbaert. The file is generated by `scripts/gen_common_words.py`.

