## US listing snapshot

`engine/research/data/us_listings.txt` is generated by
`scripts/gen_us_listings.py` from the NASDAQ Trader symbol directory:

- <https://www.nasdaqtrader.com/dynamic/SymDir/nasdaqlisted.txt>
- <https://www.nasdaqtrader.com/dynamic/SymDir/otherlisted.txt>
  (NYSE, NYSE American, NYSE Arca, and Cboe)

Test issues are excluded. Class-share dots are stored in Yahoo form
(`BRK.B` becomes `BRK-B`).

The directory is published by Nasdaq, Inc. for symbol lookup. Use of the
files is subject to the NASDAQ Trader symbol-directory terms:
<https://www.nasdaqtrader.com/Trader.aspx?id=symbollookup>.
The snapshot is a point-in-time copy for identifying whether a token is a
listed US symbol. It is not a redistribution of market data, and it is not
the S&P universe used as a research pool.
